{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Gutfarm! The soil and climate here are perfect for growing crops, but every nightfall, monsters will surge in like a tidal wave...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plowing, sowing, watering... Dozens of crops await your discovery, each with a wildly imaginative mutated variety that brings unexpected surprises\u2014or shocks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/farm.png?t=1746179258\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tower Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters are swarming in like tides\u2014defend yourself with your plants! How will you combine different types of plant turrets? How will you place fences to alter the monsters' path? Will you go for a hands-on parkour style, or a safe and passive approach? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/trap.png?t=1746179258\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t forget to boost your survival skills! Gather resources, craft tools, and always make sure your backpack is stocked with enough food. Use relics dropped by monsters to upgrade both your plants and yourself\u2014only then can you make it through the perils of this treacherous island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/\u5236\u9020.png?t=1746179258\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/\u9057\u7269.png?t=1746179258\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678130?t=1746179258","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a